title: High Inflation
subtitle: Workers are seeing their purchasing power decline.
view-if: inflation >= 25 and high_inflation_timer = 0
new-page: true
tags: event
on-arrival: {!
  Q.capital_flight_progress += 0.5;
  Q.industry *= 0.99; Q.crime_rate += 3; Q.food_sold -= 0.002;
  Q,high_inflation_timer = 6;
  Q.workers_unrest += 2; 
!}


= High Inflation

Prices are spiralling out of control, and everyone across Russia is seeing their purchasing power decline. The workers are suffering, unable to purchase enough food and necessities. Factories are having difficulty maintaining their supply chains. The peasants are hoarding grain, since inflation is making currency useless.

Is there anything we can do?

- @organize_expropriations
- @raise_taxes
- @slash_welfare
- @austerity
- @price_controls
- @nothing: Nothing can be done.

@organize_expropriations
title: Organize a round of expropriations from the capitalists! 
choose-if: elites_wealth > 5
unavailable-subtitle: There is nothing left to expropriate. 
on-arrival: {!
  if (Q.elites_wealth >= 30) {
    Q.elites_wealth -= 2;
    Q.resources += 1;
  }
  if (Q.elites_wealth >= 20) {
    Q.elites_wealth -= 2;
    Q.resources += 1;
  }
  if (Q.elites_wealth >= 10) {
    Q.elites_wealth -= 1;
    Q.resources += 1;
  }
  if (Q.middle_wealth >= 20) {
    Q.middle_wealth -= 2;
    Q.resources += 1;
  }
  Q.elites_wealth -= 1; Q.resources += 1;
  Q.capital_flight_progress += 0.5; Q.monthly_inflation *= 0.95; Q.instability += 3;
  Q.elites_unrest += 5; Q.middle_unrest += 2.5; Q.workers_unrest -= 5; Q.peasants_unrest -= 5; Q.kulaks_unrest -= 5; Q.intelligentsia_unrest += 2; 
!}

@raise_taxes 
title: Raise current taxation rates across the board. 
choose-if: finance_minister_party = "Bolshevik"
unavailable-subtitle: We don't control financial policy. 
on-arrival: {!
  Q.wealth_tax_rate += 0.5; Q.business_tax_rate += 0.5; 
  Q.income_tax_rate_1 += 0.5; Q.income_tax_rate_2 += 0.5; Q.income_tax_rate_3 += 0.5; Q.income_tax_rate_4 += 0.5; Q.income_tax_rate_5 += 0.5;
  Q.capital_flight_progress += 0.5; Q.monthly_inflation *= 0.85;
  if (Q.income_tax_rate_1 >= 2.5) Q.capital_flight_progress += 1;
  Q.elites_unrest += 2.5; Q.middle_unrest += 2.5; Q.workers_unrest += 5; Q.peasants_unrest += 5; Q.kulaks_unrest += 5;
!}

@slash_welfare
title: Cut funding for welfare programs.  
choose-if: welfare_minister_party = "Bolshevik" and welfare_expend > 0.25
unavailable-subtitle: [?if welfare_minister_party != "Bolshevik" : We don't control welfare policy. ?][?if welfare_expend <= 0.25 : Welfare is already negligable. ?]
on-arrival: {!
  Q.welfare_expend *= 0.5; 
  Q.workers_unrest += 5; Q.underclass_unrest += 10;
  Q.monthly_inflation *= 0.9;
!}

@austerity
title: Impose a program of full austerity.
subtitle: Raise taxes, cut government spending.
view-if: prime_minister_party = "Bolshevik" or finance_minister_party = "Bolshevik"
on-arrival: {!
  Q.wealth_tax_rate += 0.25; Q.business_tax_rate += 0.25; 
  Q.income_tax_rate_1 += 0.25; Q.income_tax_rate_2 += 0.25; Q.income_tax_rate_3 += 0.25; Q.income_tax_rate_4 += 0.25; Q.income_tax_rate_5 += 0.25;
  Q.capital_flight_progress += 0.25; Q.train_capacity *= 0.999; 
  Q.elites_unrest += 2.5; Q.middle_unrest += 2.5; Q.workers_unrest += 5; Q.peasants_unrest += 5; Q.kulaks_unrest += 5;
  Q.efficacy_finance -= 0.1; Q.efficacy_foreign -= 0.1; Q.efficacy_military -= 0.1; Q.efficacy_enlightenment -= 0.1; Q.efficacy_internal -= 0.1; Q.efficacy_railways -= 0.1; Q.efficacy_trade -= 0.1; Q.efficacy_justice -= 0.1; Q.efficacy_agriculture -= 0.1; Q.efficacy_foodsupply -= 0.1; Q.efficacy_nationalities -= 0.1; Q.efficacy_welfare -= 0.1;
  Q.foreignaffairs_expend -= 0.25; Q.military_expend -= 0.25; Q.enlightmenet_expend -= 0.25; Q.railways_expend -= 0.25; Q.trade_expend -= 0.25; Q.finance_expend -= 0.25; Q.justice_expend -= 0.25; Q.agriculture_expend -= 0.25; Q.foodsupply_expend -= 0.25; Q.nationalities_expend -= 0.25;
  Q.welfare_expend *= 0.5;
  Q.monthly_inflation *= 0.8; 
!}

Our program of austerity severely hurts the workers, middle class, and soldiers.

@price_controls
title: Impose price controls and rationing on basic necessities.
subtitle: This may simply push trade to the black market.
unavailable-subtitle: We don't control financial policy. 
choose-if: finance_minister_party = "Bolshevik"
on-arrival: {!
  Q.monthly_inflation *= 0.95; 
  Q.food_sold -= 0.001;
  Q.workers_unrest += 4; Q.underclass_unrest += 8; 
!}

Price controls and rationing can reduce prices for some goods, but it only further depresses the amount of grain sold by peasants.


@nothing
on-arrival: workers_unrest += 2.5; peasants_unrest += 2.5; instability += 1; 

There is nothing we can do about this.
